{
  "uid": "omp-notification-service",
  "title": "OMP — Notification Service",
  "tags": ["omp", "service", "notification-service", "websocket", "kafka"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"omp-services\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "WebSocket Health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Connections",
      "description": "Current WebSocket connections across all replicas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(websocket_connections_active{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Subscriptions",
      "description": "Current subscriptions across all replicas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(websocket_subscriptions_active{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Connection Rate (5m)",
      "description": "New WebSocket connections per second.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(websocket_connections_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 2, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disconnect Rate (5m)",
      "description": "WebSocket disconnects per second, including policy violations (backpressure).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(websocket_disconnects_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connections & Subscriptions",
      "description": "Active connections and subscriptions over time.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(websocket_connections_active{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})", "legendFormat": "connections" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(websocket_subscriptions_active{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})", "legendFormat": "subscriptions" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "sum(websocket_sessions_active{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})", "legendFormat": "sessions" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disconnects by Reason",
      "description": "Disconnects split by reason. 'policy_violation' indicates backpressure (slow client). 'abnormal' indicates network issues.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(websocket_disconnects_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{reason}}" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "policy_violation" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "abnormal" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "normal" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Event Pipeline",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pipeline Throughput",
      "description": "Events per second at each stage: Kafka consumed → Redis published → WebSocket dispatched. Gaps indicate pipeline issues.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(kafka_events_consumed_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "Kafka consumed" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(rate(redis_events_published_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "Redis published" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "sum(rate(redis_events_received_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "Redis received" },
        { "refId": "D", "expr": "sum(rate(websocket_events_dispatched_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "WebSocket dispatched" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Kafka Consumer Lag",
      "description": "Kafka consumer lag per partition. Rising lag indicates the consumer can't keep up with the producer.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag_max{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"})", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer Errors",
      "description": "Parse failures and other consumer errors.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(kafka_events_failed_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "kafka failures" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(rate(redis_publish_errors_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "redis publish errors" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "sum(rate(redis_events_failed_total{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "redis processing failures" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 30, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "JVM",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Heap Memory",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\",area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "used" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\",area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "max" }
      ],
      "options": { "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }, "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC Pause Time",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "rate(jvm_gc_pause_seconds_sum{application=\"notification-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m])", "legendFormat": "{{cause}}" }
      ],
      "options": { "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }, "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Quick Links",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Deeper Investigation\n\n- [**Prometheus**](http://prometheus.localhost)\n- [**Grafana Explore → Loki**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22%7D) — `service=\"notification-service\"`\n- [**Grafana Explore → Tempo**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D)\n- [**Kafka UI**](http://kafka-ui.localhost) — topics, consumer groups, lag\n\n### WebSocket Client Tooling\n\nReference client implementation: [`docs/websocket-client-guide.md`](../../docs/websocket-client-guide.md)\n\n### Pipeline Health Interpretation\n\nIf **Kafka consumed** rate > **WebSocket dispatched** rate:\n- No clients are subscribed (harmless)\n- Or Redis/WebSocket dispatch is failing (check Consumer Errors panel)\n\nIf **Kafka consumed** is 0 but producers are publishing:\n- Consumer group is broken (check Kafka UI)\n- Or the notification-service replica is disconnected from Kafka"
      }
    }
  ]
}